      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T17:54:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack.\n\nNote that this program currently deletes the binary and resources after the test finishes. IIUC your proposed optimization would require caching the static resources on the device for use by subsequent tests.\n\nFrom my experiments with Pixel 5 and Pixel 7 phones, uploading the resources is pretty much instantaneous, so I don\u0027t think caching the resources would be worth it. But it might be slower on other devices, or if we need to upload things other than the `//resources` directory, so your proposal is something to keep in mind.",
      "parentUuid": "9f65691c_88fdaac5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 12,
