      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T18:02:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. That caching is similar to how tests are done today and I believe that is done for a good reason - performance and reduced write cycles on the flash memory.",
      "parentUuid": "4a78faa1_3500f508",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
